Z||000001||Monkeyman||10-15-2001||06:12 AM||||I think that the newer Moosetangs are ugly and generic looking.  And Ford really bit the big one when they designed those Rustang IIs.  I think most Mudstains are overpriced and underdeveloped.  As far as I'm concerned, the only one's (I've run out of alternate Mustang names) that had any character were the pre-Mustang IIs.  I'd gladly take most of those.<P>I wouldn't worry too much about what others say about your car, whether it's a 'Stang or a Fiero.  Most of my employees talk (badly) about my Fiero everyday.  I don't enjoy hearing all the that's-an-ugly-car stuff about my pride and joy, but I figure they're entitled to their opinion (even if it is wrong  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> ).  Just let it go and enjoy your ride(s).||||reg||1
