Z||000011||Gerald||10-15-2001||12:56 PM||||I like most cars. When you think about it any car is something to be marvoled at. So many little pecies coming together to form a compleat mode of transportation. If I had to choose between walking and driving a civic. Id drive the civic. Hey at least im warm right. I think car bashing has gone to far. What you think about somones stang, they may think about your fiero. If somone wants a car Im not gonna sit there and tell them to get something different unless theres a valid reason. Not just because I dont like it. I dislike J cars. Not because I think theyr ugly or slow. I happen to think their good looking and fast. I hate them because everyone and their mom has one. I was thinking about buying a sunfire this summer. I didnt because I loved my fiero too much. After i made my decision I counted the number of j cars in my apt buildings parking lot. There was over 20 as opposed to the 2 fieros. One of which was mine. The other fiero is in the stall next to me.<BR>Ok im getting off topic here. Im done.<P>------------------<BR>87 coupe 5 spd||||reg||1
