Z||000019||GTFiero1||10-15-2001||06:15 PM||||i just dont like the mustang period. but thats me and i am titled to my opinion. i rode in a 2000 (I belive) annerversary edition or GT i forget now. I wasnt too impressed. although the new ones finally got rid of the past traction problems. Every one has the 80's mustangs and i mean everyone, i cant walk down a street with out seeing one. I think there boring. Besides, The Camaro kicked the mustangs @$$ in the Car and Driver tests. I dont like the fact that the recent ford commercials say "Mustang, Americas original muscle car..." its not americas original muscle car. The PONTIAC GTO is. the Mustang is americas original secretaries car. thats what it was marketed as....remember<P>------------------<BR>Adam J. B.||||reg||1
