Z||000024||Formula88||10-16-2001||12:56 AM||||While I have no love of Ford products (at least after 1973), I have no problem with people who like their Muscrats.  But as LZeitgeist said, this is a Fiero forum, so I don't want to hear about Mustangs.  If I wanted to read about Mustangs, I'd read a Mustang forum.<P>If a Muscrat owner thinks his car is better than my Fiero, fine.  More power to him/her.  I personally think they're crap.  I drove a 2000 V6 Mustang while my 99 Grand Am V6 was in the shop.  My Grand Am felt more solid, handled better, and had WAY more power, not to mention more room.  I don't see the allure.  And I don't have to.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif">||||reg||1
