Z||000028||Slammed Fiero||10-16-2001||12:02 PM||||No doubt the coolest mustang has to be Bullit. I'm not talkin the new retro Bullit (Although I do like it) But the original one Steve McQueen drove in Bullit.<P>2nd coolest... Eleanor from Gone in 60 (Newer bruckheimer version , designed by Chip Foos I believe) Nice car.<P>Those were mustangs. I like our 95 5.0ltr. But it's a bit softly sprung , could use an independent rear suspension and a Auto tranny that didn't think so much. Good car for my mom.<P>I had an altercation in it with a friend who has an 89 MR2 SC , The car is modded , dead even drag race but as soon as we hit an offramp I felt like I was in a milk truck. The 17's were screaching and howling , body roll. You can't beat a mid engined car for steady state cornering.<P>Nice car , just not for me.. I like corners more  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>JM ||||reg||1
Z||000029||Voytek||10-16-2001||02:05 PM||||Mustangs suck.<P><BR>Oops, wrong thread.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/voyteks_sig2.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000030||Little Duce Coupe||10-17-2001||08:21 PM||||A new members opinion (ok.. Rant)<BR>&gt; for what its worth.<P>One of the reasons I like my Fiero is its uniqueness but as important is because most people I have met that own Fieros are "Car" people.<BR>That is to say they have an inherant appreciation of how cars were built, thier history, what they were built for... on.. and on etc.. etc....<P>As someone who grew up in a family that sold cars for a living (just about every major maker) and who also sold cars for a while (please don't flame me.. I bailed cause I didn't have the heart) I learned that every maker and every model has it's shining years and its bad years but they all have one thing in common.... thier transportation..period, some for fun.. some for utility.<P>I did however decide to keep my little coupe after finding about the "Fiero Shop" in California and this forum.  I had become discouraged with inability to find good advice or honest work locally and had about all but given up  (I ain't that mechanical).<P>This forum has been abundant on both accounts, much to my wife's chagrin. ($$)<P>In all honesty I don't come here to compare my car to anything but another Fiero and get some advice.  I am not flaming anybody I just don't care about other cars in general because I don't own them,,,, I have a Fiero.<P>I don't care about speed... I have an GSE1150 E for that. <BR>I care about reading and talking with people with the same CAR type interests without using profane language or bashing other peoples interests.<P>Ahhh..... srry been readin for awhile and just had to get that out...<P>PS<BR>When are you not considered a "new member"?<P>------------------<BR>Little Duce Coupe<BR>"You Don't Know What She Costs"||||reg||5
Z||000031||Cheever3000||10-17-2001||08:31 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>When are you not considered a "new member"?<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>I think it's after you've made a mere 25 or 35 posts.  That would be about 24 hours for me.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I just started reading all the Mustang stuff tonight when I noticed the locked-down topics.  Good grief, what a waste of keystrokes (on everybody's part)!  Thank you, Cliff!<P><BR>||||reg||1
Z||000032||Formula||10-17-2001||08:52 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Little Duce Coupe:<BR><B><BR>When are you not considered a "new member"?<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>When you send me a Money Order for $500.53.<P>You get all the cool features after that like the ability to fly, laser vision, bullet proof, but you have a severe alergy to kryptonite, only one person has sent me the dough though, I think it was a clark kent out of a small country town.  Anyways, welcome to the forum, After you post a while I'll change it to member.......<P>Just think,I can give you all those powers, just imagine what cliff can do!!!!!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Formula_sigx21.gif"> ||||reg||1
